    10 \\/ 05 \\/ 2000\\r\",\"parentUIDs\":[278],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Briefing\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":277}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":361.668884,\"yPos\":-2631.324},\"ID\":278,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"  
    *A spoonful of lies and crime*\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":true,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":2,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":282},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":283}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-688.9974,\"yPos\":-1409.31335},\"ID\":281,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    will ask you some questions, Andrew.\",\"parentUIDs\":[279],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":285}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1774.344,\"yPos\":-1464.64832},\"ID\":284,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh!
    Simple! I'd go get an ice cream!\",\"parentUIDs\":[283],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":286}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1764.33862,\"yPos\":-1293.32},\"ID\":285,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Why
    are you so obsessed with ice cream?\",\"parentUIDs\":[284],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":287},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":288}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1347.008,\"yPos\":-1281.31433},\"ID\":286,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"It's
    my favourite food! It's one my mum used to make when... She was still alive.\",\"parentUIDs\":[285],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":292}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1841.01025,\"yPos\":-1095.32654},\"ID\":289,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'd
    fight! And get it myself.\",\"parentUIDs\":[288],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":293}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2198.337,\"yPos\":-1209.98547},\"ID\":292,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"So
    you admit that you would attack people who deny you things. Interesting.\",\"parentUIDs\":[289],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":294},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":295}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2231.664,\"yPos\":-1055.99377},\"ID\":293,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No!
    No! I meant I would be determined! Not violent! Please! I wouldn't hurt anyone
    that isn't trying to hurt me.\",\"parentUIDs\":[292],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":297}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2530.32764,\"yPos\":-873.337036},\"ID\":296,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Considering
    your charge, I doubt that is true, Mr. Colmenero.\",\"parentUIDs\":[295],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":298}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2508.32813,\"yPos\":-718.675659},\"ID\":297,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    don't understand! They were evil cultists!\",\"parentUIDs\":[296],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":299}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2529.65967,\"yPos\":-547.3342},\"ID\":298,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"So
    you admit that you felt they were evil?\",\"parentUIDs\":[297],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":300}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2512.99463,\"yPos\":-427.3362},\"ID\":299,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Yes!\",\"parentUIDs\":[298],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":301}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2534.99463,\"yPos\":-303.3295},\"ID\":300,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"And...
    What would stop you in this case from attacking them?\",\"parentUIDs\":[299],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":302}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2776.998,\"yPos\":-283.9951},\"ID\":301,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
