    course, your honour.\",\"parentUIDs\":[302],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bailiff\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":305}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2805.66113,\"yPos\":-722.008667},\"ID\":304,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(You
    read the files Maria gave you. They all were completely normal people with no
    track reccord of anything suspicious.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[303],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":306}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2786.99414,\"yPos\":-859.337036},\"ID\":305,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"They
    were completely normal people, Andrew. Not satanists.\",\"parentUIDs\":[304],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":308},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":309}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3148.32178,\"yPos\":-876.669067},\"ID\":306,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You're
    being tricked! You're...\",\"parentUIDs\":[305],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":311}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3052.98779,\"yPos\":-601.3345},\"ID\":310,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    They were fast food workers! They are all evil! Like the ones who killed my parents!\",\"parentUIDs\":[309],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":312}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3046.98535,\"yPos\":-452.002716},\"ID\":311,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Knowhing
    the guy is a bit coco, you read his file again and checks some smaller print
    details. Indeed his parents were killed by satanists costumed as fast food workers.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[310],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":313}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3044.98584,\"yPos\":-291.9932},\"ID\":312,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"While
    I see why you think that. That is in no way proof.\",\"parentUIDs\":[311],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":314}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3014.99316,\"yPos\":-149.3335},\"ID\":313,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...\",\"parentUIDs\":[312],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":315}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3018.99463,\"yPos\":-27.32544},\"ID\":314,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"In
    reality, they were normal people doing their job. You thought they were evil
    and attacked them. They weren't the killers in your story, You were. Just like
    those killers who murdered your parents.\",\"parentUIDs\":[313],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":317}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3010.33057,\"yPos\":136.6773},\"ID\":315,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    What have I done?\",\"parentUIDs\":[314],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":319},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":320}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3025.65869,\"yPos\":255.344574},\"ID\":317,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(The
    man starts crying as the realisation hits.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[315],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":322}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3300.9873,\"yPos\":529.3439},\"ID\":321,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    sorry, Andrew. But in your wish to not allow your past to repeat, you caused
    it yourself. And hurt so many people!\",\"parentUIDs\":[319],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":323}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3280.98438,\"yPos\":655.9962},\"ID\":322,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    Why did I do it? I want to take it back!\",\"parentUIDs\":[321],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":324}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3299.65332,\"yPos\":809.9884},\"ID\":323,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"There
    is no taking back what you have done! You have killed them in cold blood. But...
    You can atone.\",\"parentUIDs\":[322],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":325}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3286.31641,\"yPos\":941.975952},\"ID\":324,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Atone?\",\"parentUIDs\":[323],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":326}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3296.32031,\"yPos\":1069.3009},\"ID\":325,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Yes.
    And I'll give you the chance to do that if you dedicate yourself to it.\",\"parentUIDs\":[324],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":327}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3279.65332,\"yPos\":1225.3092},\"ID\":326,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    will!\",\"parentUIDs\":[325],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":255}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2620.983,\"yPos\":1227.97327},\"ID\":327,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Then...
    I sentence you to...\",\"parentUIDs\":[326],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2826.99121,\"yPos\":570.002563},\"ID\":328,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    are a vile person, Colmenero! You absolutely disgust me! It's time for you to
    pay for what you've done! I sentence you to...\",\"parentUIDs\":[320],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":330}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3421.64844,\"yPos\":-528.6677},\"ID\":329,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No,
    I'm not!\",\"parentUIDs\":[308],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":331}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3458.3208,\"yPos\":-375.994659},\"ID\":330,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Yes,
    you are, Colmenero! You killed people in cold blood and now are trying to come
    up with stupid excuses! Well, no more! Andrew Colmenero! I sentecn you to...\",\"parentUIDs\":[329],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":332}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3468.98828,\"yPos\":-188.665039},\"ID\":331,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No
    please!\",\"parentUIDs\":[330],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-3476.98242,\"yPos\":61.3433228},\"ID\":332,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    are not getting out of this one!\",\"parentUIDs\":[331],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":334}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-925.004456,\"yPos\":-1098.6615},\"ID\":333,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"She
    was the kindest person I've ever known! I loved her so much! But then! Those!
    Those... Those evil people took her from me! I'll never forgive them!\",\"parentUIDs\":[287],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":209},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":336}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-917.001,\"yPos\":-846.671},\"ID\":334,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Interesting\",\"parentUIDs\":[333],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":288}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1426.33862,\"yPos\":-697.334351},\"ID\":337,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"More
    than anything!\",\"parentUIDs\":[336],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":339}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-720.9991,\"yPos\":-1769.98083},\"ID\":338,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Mice.
    And dark places.\",\"parentUIDs\":[282],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":340}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-990.334839,\"yPos\":-1799.32239},\"ID\":339,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    meant in terms of what sentence you'll get.\",\"parentUIDs\":[338],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":283}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1333.67261,\"yPos\":-1883.98767},\"ID\":340,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    not afraid! Why would I be? I'm innocent!\",\"parentUIDs\":[339],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":342}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-2168.33984,\"yPos\":-557.996338},\"ID\":341,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Ok,
    Andrew. I trust you.\",\"parentUIDs\":[294],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":343}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1803.67822,\"yPos\":-569.999},\"ID\":342,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Thank
    you! I promise you! I'm just misunderstood!\",\"parentUIDs\":[341],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":205}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1811.68066,\"yPos\":-800.6741},\"ID\":343,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Misunderstood...
    Ok.\",\"parentUIDs\":[342],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":722.069763,\"yPos\":3976.97681},\"ID\":345,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh
    no...\",\"parentUIDs\":[99],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":3}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":369.99884,\"yPos\":-2415.33545},\"ID\":348,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Charge:
    Murder charge with a spoon at a fast food restaurant over the ice cream machine
    not working.\\r\",\"parentUIDs\":[277],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Briefing\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1}]}"
